<title>UK: TELKOM  AT $28 IN LONDON.</title>
<headline>TELKOM  AT $28 IN LONDON.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telekomunikasi Indonesia (Telkom) closed at $28 in London on Monday. It recorded the day's low of $28 and the day's high of $29.25.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Friday as $29.2.</p>
<p>One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares. -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364.</p>
